    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft &amp; Race!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft you race with freedom and creativity! Make your own vehicles, characters and tracks by combining simple shapes together without any restrictions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly configure your race as you want: the decorations, power-ups, moving obstacles and let's go!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to race? Go! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/776b657d0cb826736791ec8bfcecc8e5.poster.avif?t=1754991306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/776b657d0cb826736791ec8bfcecc8e5.webm?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/776b657d0cb826736791ec8bfcecc8e5.mp4?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform stunts, push, and rush to the finish line as fast as you can!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win tracks and models. Race as much as you want with endless fun!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race solo or up to 4 players!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split Screen local multiplayer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/daecea26c1e33d4d384a823fabbfc294.poster.avif?t=1754991306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/daecea26c1e33d4d384a823fabbfc294.webm?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/daecea26c1e33d4d384a823fabbfc294.mp4?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft your racing tracks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/2fca2ee798c84eb1717e8d5f8ce43ea2.poster.avif?t=1754991306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/2fca2ee798c84eb1717e8d5f8ce43ea2.webm?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/2fca2ee798c84eb1717e8d5f8ce43ea2.mp4?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit existing tracks or create new ones from scratch in any theme (cars, beach, bedroom, workshop, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add jumps, decorations, and obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use funny models as checkpoints and direction signs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft your characters and opponents!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/009b356084354b18760f3b7c30b278ae.poster.avif?t=1754991306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/009b356084354b18760f3b7c30b278ae.webm?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/009b356084354b18760f3b7c30b278ae.mp4?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize any character or create your own. Bring any idea you can imagine to life, like a creature with a robot body and two animal heads. You choose!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft your Vehicles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/067a6a362b6db3565c8c92854ee9f5e6.poster.avif?t=1754991306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/067a6a362b6db3565c8c92854ee9f5e6.webm?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/067a6a362b6db3565c8c92854ee9f5e6.mp4?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from classic options like karts, buggies, racing cars, and trucks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or go for funnier ones like a bath vehicle, a sofa car, or a tiger rover. Anything is possible!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist now and try the Demo!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the Wishlist button now!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the demo and let me know any ideas!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft &amp; Race!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft you race with freedom and creativity! Make your own vehicles, characters and tracks by combining simple shapes together without any restrictions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly configure your race as you want: the decorations, power-ups, moving obstacles and let's go!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to race? Go! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/776b657d0cb826736791ec8bfcecc8e5.poster.avif?t=1754991306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/776b657d0cb826736791ec8bfcecc8e5.webm?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/776b657d0cb826736791ec8bfcecc8e5.mp4?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform stunts, push, and rush to the finish line as fast as you can!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win tracks and models. Race as much as you want with endless fun!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race solo or up to 4 players!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split Screen local multiplayer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/daecea26c1e33d4d384a823fabbfc294.poster.avif?t=1754991306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/daecea26c1e33d4d384a823fabbfc294.webm?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/daecea26c1e33d4d384a823fabbfc294.mp4?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft your racing tracks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/2fca2ee798c84eb1717e8d5f8ce43ea2.poster.avif?t=1754991306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/2fca2ee798c84eb1717e8d5f8ce43ea2.webm?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/2fca2ee798c84eb1717e8d5f8ce43ea2.mp4?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit existing tracks or create new ones from scratch in any theme (cars, beach, bedroom, workshop, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add jumps, decorations, and obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use funny models as checkpoints and direction signs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft your characters and opponents!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/009b356084354b18760f3b7c30b278ae.poster.avif?t=1754991306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/009b356084354b18760f3b7c30b278ae.webm?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/009b356084354b18760f3b7c30b278ae.mp4?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize any character or create your own. Bring any idea you can imagine to life, like a creature with a robot body and two animal heads. You choose!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft your Vehicles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/067a6a362b6db3565c8c92854ee9f5e6.poster.avif?t=1754991306\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/067a6a362b6db3565c8c92854ee9f5e6.webm?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/067a6a362b6db3565c8c92854ee9f5e6.mp4?t=1754991306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from classic options like karts, buggies, racing cars, and trucks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or go for funnier ones like a bath vehicle, a sofa car, or a tiger rover. Anything is possible!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist now and try the Demo!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the Wishlist button now!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the demo and let me know any ideas!</p></li></ul>",
